WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.845
This simple record illustrates representation
cleaning The name changes

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:13.136
spacing and display case The email is trimmed and
lowercased The

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:20.538
phone keeps only digits Each transformation is
explainable But

00:00:20.564 --> 00:00:26.305
the cleaned value should not erase the source
evidence In many analytical

00:00:26.331 --> 00:00:29.278
workflows raw and cleaned layers are both valuable
